text:
add it to Waybar
In ~/.config/waybar/config.jsonc:
"custom/calendar": {
  "format": "",
  "tooltip": false,
  "on-click": "~/.config/waybar/scripts/calendar.sh"
}
Add "custom/calendar" to the appropriate modules list.
For spacing, in ~/.config/waybar/styles.css:
#custom-calendar {
  min-width: 12px;
  margin: 0 18px;
}
Reload Waybar:
pkill waybar && waybar &
